
@startuml
title Figure 6 - Polyglot plugin (compact, vertical)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam Component {
  RoundCorner 12
}
top to bottom direction
scale 0.9

package "RBciAD Host (Python)" {
  [Reactive Engine] as Rx
  [Plugin API\n(Python nodes)] as PyAPI
  [Polyglot Wrapper] as Wrap
  folder "temp_io/" as TMP
}

node "External process\n(C++ / Rust / Node.js / R / .exe)" as EXT

' --- Main calls / data flow (vertical) ---
Rx ..> PyAPI : in-process\nexecute
PyAPI --> Wrap : call external node

Wrap --> TMP : write\ninput_<name>_<id>.json
Wrap --> EXT : spawn process\n(args include paths)
EXT --> TMP : write\noutput_<name>_<id>.json
TMP --> Wrap : read output
Wrap --> PyAPI : outputs / errors
PyAPI --> Rx : return

note right of Wrap
- Command from file extension
- Timeout & exit code (isolation)
- Easy debugging
end note

note right of TMP
Per-instance filenames avoid collisions.
Large tensors: pass path to binary/memmap
instead of serializing JSON payloads.
end note
@enduml
